     "description": "With their season on the line in Game 7, Cole Perfetti and the Jets fought desperately to stay alive. Already on the scoresheet earlier in the game, Perfetti delivered in dramatic fashion, scoring with just three seconds left in regulation\u2014the latest game-tying goal in a Game 7 in NHL history.  \r\nStationed in front of the net, Perfetti redirected the puck past the goaltender, igniting an electric roar from the Winnipeg crowd and forcing overtime. Thanks to Perfetti\u2019s clutch heroics, the Jets seized their moment in the extra frame, clinching the series on Adam Lowry\u2019s game-winning goal.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
